{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"nav":1},[2,31],{"label":3,"items":4},"Start",[5,21],{"title":6,"path":7,"headings":8},"Getting started","/docs/getting-started",[9,12,15,18],{"id":10,"text":11},"open-scratch","Open Scratch",{"id":13,"text":14},"add-five-numbers","Add five numbers",{"id":16,"text":17},"change-the-shortcuts","Change the shortcuts",{"id":19,"text":20},"choose-the-look-and-motion","Choose the look and motion",{"title":22,"path":23,"headings":24},"Keyboard Shortcuts","/docs/shortcuts",[25,28],{"id":26,"text":27},"switch-sheets","Switch sheets",{"id":29,"text":30},"nudge-a-number-or-date","Nudge a number or date",{"label":32,"items":33},"Guides",[34,113,129,166,182,192],{"title":35,"path":36,"headings":37},"Grid and shortcuts","/docs/grid",[38,41,44,47,50,53,56,59,62,65,68,71,74,77,80,83,86,89,92,95,98,101,104,107,110],{"id":39,"text":40},"grid-toolbar","Grid toolbar",{"id":42,"text":43},"move-and-select","Move and select",{"id":45,"text":46},"complete-a-formula","Complete a formula",{"id":48,"text":49},"select-separate-ranges","Select separate ranges",{"id":51,"text":52},"save-a-named-range","Save a named range",{"id":54,"text":55},"named-tables","Named tables",{"id":57,"text":58},"add-borders-or-style-a-table","Add borders or style a table",{"id":60,"text":61},"duplicate-a-sheet-or-import-a-file","Duplicate a sheet or import a file",{"id":63,"text":64},"insert-or-delete-rows-and-columns","Insert or delete rows and columns",{"id":66,"text":67},"move-hide-or-resize-rows-and-columns","Move, hide or resize rows and columns",{"id":69,"text":70},"freeze-rows-and-columns","Freeze rows and columns",{"id":72,"text":73},"sort-rows","Sort rows",{"id":75,"text":76},"filter-rows","Filter rows",{"id":78,"text":79},"resize-the-window","Resize the window",{"id":81,"text":82},"move-or-detach-panes","Move or detach panes",{"id":84,"text":85},"open-a-sheet-in-its-own-window","Open a sheet in its own window",{"id":87,"text":88},"drag-out-a-table-or-export-csv","Drag out a table or export CSV",{"id":90,"text":91},"copy-a-range-for-another-app","Copy a range for another app",{"id":93,"text":94},"workbooks-and-sheet-archive","Workbooks and sheet archive",{"id":96,"text":97},"tsv-and-excel-files","TSV and Excel files",{"id":99,"text":100},"preview-paste-and-fill","Preview paste and fill",{"id":102,"text":103},"format-a-range","Format a range",{"id":105,"text":106},"calculate-and-copy","Calculate and copy",{"id":108,"text":109},"work-across-sheets","Work across sheets",{"id":111,"text":112},"check-inputs-as-you-edit","Check inputs as you edit",{"title":114,"path":115,"headings":116},"Capture and paste","/docs/capture",[117,120,123,126],{"id":118,"text":119},"capture-amounts","Capture amounts",{"id":121,"text":122},"read-a-screenshot","Read a screenshot",{"id":124,"text":125},"choose-how-to-paste","Choose how to paste",{"id":127,"text":128},"fill-a-series","Fill a series",{"title":130,"path":131,"headings":132},"Notes and Obsidian","/docs/notes-and-obsidian",[133,136,139,142,145,148,151,154,157,160,163],{"id":134,"text":135},"move-notes","Move Notes",{"id":137,"text":138},"resize-notes","Resize Notes",{"id":140,"text":141},"format-a-note","Format a note",{"id":143,"text":144},"annotate-a-cell-or-range","Annotate a cell or range",{"id":146,"text":147},"put-a-live-result-in-a-note","Put a live result in a note",{"id":149,"text":150},"repair-a-note-link","Repair a note link",{"id":152,"text":153},"send-the-table-and-notes","Send the table and notes",{"id":155,"text":156},"save-a-dated-sheet-note","Save a dated sheet note",{"id":158,"text":159},"edit-a-table-in-both-scratch-and-obsidian","Edit a table in both Scratch and Obsidian",{"id":161,"text":162},"open-an-export-in-scratch","Open an export in Scratch",{"id":164,"text":165},"search-your-obsidian-vault","Search your Obsidian vault",{"title":167,"path":168,"headings":169},"Formula Microscope","/docs/formula-microscope",[170,173,176,179],{"id":171,"text":172},"read-a-calculation","Read a calculation",{"id":174,"text":175},"find-a-cell-behind-an-error","Find a cell behind an error",{"id":177,"text":178},"match-formula-references-to-the-grid","Match formula references to the grid",{"id":180,"text":181},"see-where-a-pinned-result-came-from","See where a pinned result came from",{"title":183,"path":184,"headings":185},"Selection History","/docs/history",[186,189],{"id":187,"text":188},"compare-a-revision","Compare a revision",{"id":190,"text":191},"restore-just-the-range","Restore just the range",{"title":193,"path":194,"headings":195},"Record and Replay","/docs/replay",[196],{"id":197,"text":198},"try-it-on-another-range","Try it on another range"],"uses":{}},{"type":"data","data":[{"doc":1,"prev":7,"next":8},{"title":2,"description":3,"html":4,"path":5,"group":6},"Getting started","Open Scratch and calculate your first total.","\u003Cp class=\"lead\">Scratch is a floating spreadsheet for macOS. Its menu bar icon and global shortcut bring up the same workbook from any app.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"open-scratch\">Open Scratch\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#open-scratch\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">\u003Csvg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cpath d=\"M6.5 9.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 0l2.2-2.2a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4-4l-.7.7\"/>\u003Cpath d=\"M9.5 6.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4 0L3.3 8.7a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 4l.7-.7\"/>\u003C/svg>\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Scratch is in local preview. If you have a copy of the source, run \u003Ccode>make run\u003C/code> from its folder. The build needs macOS 14 or later and Swift 6.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Click Scratch’s menu bar icon or press ⌥ Space. Press Escape on the grid to dismiss it. Open it again to resume at the same selection. The pin beside Notes keeps the grid visible when you switch apps.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>On an empty sheet, look at the lower left for a first-run hint. Start typing to edit the selected cell. The hints for typing, opening the command palette and hiding Scratch each retire after you use the action.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cfigure class=\"scratch-media\">\n\u003Cimg class=\"scratch-light\" src=\"/docs/empty-sheet-hint-light.webp\" alt=\"A new sheet with A1 selected and a Type to start hint at the lower left.\" width=\"547\" height=\"337\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\u003Cimg class=\"scratch-dark\" src=\"/docs/empty-sheet-hint-dark.webp\" alt=\"A new sheet with A1 selected and a Type to start hint at the lower left.\" width=\"547\" height=\"337\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\u003C/figure>\u003Ch2 id=\"add-five-numbers\">Add five numbers\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#add-five-numbers\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">\u003Csvg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cpath d=\"M6.5 9.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 0l2.2-2.2a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4-4l-.7.7\"/>\u003Cpath d=\"M9.5 6.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4 0L3.3 8.7a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 4l.7-.7\"/>\u003C/svg>\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>Type a number and press Return. Repeat for five consecutive rows in column A.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>In A6, type \u003Ccode>=su\u003C/code> and press Tab to complete \u003Ccode>=SUM(\u003C/code>.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Press Shift+Up five times to select A1:A5. Press Return to show the total.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Change one of the inputs. The total updates automatically.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Cfigure class=\"scratch-media\">\n\u003Cvideo class=\"scratch-light\" controls muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" aria-label=\"Select five values, enter SUM in A6 and extend the reference to A1:A5 with Shift and Up.\" poster=\"/docs/first-total-light.webp\" width=\"1080\" height=\"700\">\n\u003Csource src=\"/docs/first-total-demo-light.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n\u003C/video>\n\u003Cimg class=\"scratch-light scratch-poster\" src=\"/docs/first-total-light.webp\" alt=\"Select five values, enter SUM in A6 and extend the reference to A1:A5 with Shift and Up.\" width=\"1080\" height=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\u003Cvideo class=\"scratch-dark\" controls muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" aria-label=\"Select five values, enter SUM in A6 and extend the reference to A1:A5 with Shift and Up.\" poster=\"/docs/first-total-dark.webp\" width=\"1080\" height=\"700\">\n\u003Csource src=\"/docs/first-total-demo-dark.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n\u003C/video>\n\u003Cimg class=\"scratch-dark scratch-poster\" src=\"/docs/first-total-dark.webp\" alt=\"Select five values, enter SUM in A6 and extend the reference to A1:A5 with Shift and Up.\" width=\"1080\" height=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\u003C/figure>\u003Cp>Use ⇧⌘N to create a sheet and ⌘K to \u003Ca href=\"/docs/shortcuts#switch-sheets\">find a sheet by name\u003C/a>. Each sheet has its own grid, notes and column widths. Scratch autosaves the workbook locally. \u003Cstrong>Delete Current Sheet\u003C/strong> removes a sheet from the workbook view. \u003Cstrong>Restore Deleted Sheet\u003C/strong> recovers it, including its notes, after a restart.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"change-the-shortcuts\">Change the shortcuts\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#change-the-shortcuts\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">\u003Csvg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cpath d=\"M6.5 9.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 0l2.2-2.2a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4-4l-.7.7\"/>\u003Cpath d=\"M9.5 6.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4 0L3.3 8.7a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 4l.7-.7\"/>\u003C/svg>\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Click \u003Cstrong>⋯ → Keyboard Shortcuts\u003C/strong> to change the shortcuts for opening Scratch, capturing the clipboard, Notes or the command palette. \u003Cstrong>Capture Clipboard in New Sheet\u003C/strong> is also available from the ⋯ menu and the command palette. \u003Ca href=\"/docs/shortcuts\">Keyboard Shortcuts\u003C/a>.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-the-look-and-motion\">Choose the look and motion\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#choose-the-look-and-motion\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">\u003Csvg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cpath d=\"M6.5 9.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 0l2.2-2.2a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4-4l-.7.7\"/>\u003Cpath d=\"M9.5 6.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4 0L3.3 8.7a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 4l.7-.7\"/>\u003C/svg>\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Open \u003Cstrong>⋯\u003C/strong> and choose \u003Cstrong>Animation Style\u003C/strong>. \u003Cstrong>Natural\u003C/strong> is the default. \u003Cstrong>Snappy\u003C/strong> shortens transitions, and \u003Cstrong>Off\u003C/strong> turns them off. The docked Notes pane reveals from its divider. Nearby cell jumps scroll into view, and distant ones land with a short fade. macOS Reduce Motion skips the movement. Scratch uses a solid window background when Reduce Transparency is on.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Turn on \u003Cstrong>Follow System Accent\u003C/strong> in the same menu to use the accent from macOS. Scratch uses a coral accent by default. Formula references have their own colours so you can match the formula to the cells in the grid.\u003C/p>\n","/docs/getting-started","Start",null,{"title":9,"path":10},"Grid and shortcuts","/docs/grid"],"uses":{"params":["page"]}}]}
